ENGLISH
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository and all of its contents — source code, scripts, HTML/CSS/JS
files, texts, design, calibrated border corridor coordinates, and the
structure and organisation of the data — are the property of the author and
are protected by copyright law.

WITHOUT PRIOR WRITTEN PERMISSION FROM THE AUTHOR, YOU MAY NOT:

  1. Copy, reproduce or distribute the code or any part of it.
  2. Modify, translate or create derivative works.
  3. Use it in other projects, commercially or otherwise.
  4. Automatically harvest data (scraping, crawling) from gasolina.rs,
     including granice.json, fuel_prices.json and thumbs/, nor republish
     or resell such data.
  5. Circumvent technical access restrictions.

YOU MAY:

  - Use the gasolina.rs website for personal, non-commercial purposes.
  - Share links to pages on the site.
  - Quote individual data points with clear attribution and a visible link
    to gasolina.rs.

THIRD-PARTY DATA

The site displays data from publicly available sources (AMSS, Serbian Border
Police, Ministry of Interior, Hungarian Police, AMSM, BorderAlarm, TomTom,
the Serbian Ministry of Internal and Foreign Trade, nafta.hr and others).
That data belongs to its respective owners and is not covered by this
licence, which applies to the code, design, processing, calibration and
presentation.

Data is provided for information only, without warranty of accuracy or
completeness. The author accepts no liability for decisions made on the
basis of the displayed data.

Permissions and enquiries: gasolina.rs
